SOAPBOX: Great contest, happened the same time as the Hawaii QSO Party, so was able to kill two birds with one stone.  First time entering, so keeping my fingers crossed, LOL.  Also was able to take a break on Saturday to watch the Honolulu Little League team win the US Little League World Series and on Sunday to watch them win the World Little League World Series. Saw them when they came to Kauai and play and win the State Championship to move on to the Regionals on the Westcoast.  Awesome job boys!! Way to represent Hawaii to the rest of the World!  Looking forward to next years contest, I'LL HAVE AC IN THE SHACK!!!!  73 and Aloha to everyone I worked, good luck and see you on the airwaves. Aloha from the Island of Kauai
